Fixed — the suppression now works as documented.

The trailing em-dash after the rule list (`depend_on_referenced_packages —`) made the analyzer fail to parse the ignore, so the `depend_on_referenced_packages` info still fired. The comment is now rule-only, with the explanation on its own `//` line above it:

